 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** Similar to standard 3DGS rasterization, $O(N)$ for $N$ Gaussians per pixel, but with higher constant factors due to the per-Gaussian tangent plane calculation and Jacobian computation [S1].
-*   **Memory Complexity:** Requires storing per-Gaussian Jacobian and potentially the matrix $\mathbf{Q}$, increasing memory usage slightly compared to the fixed Jacobian of standard 3DGS [S1].
+*   **Time Complexity:** Not given in the sources.
